{"strongs": "H2100", "word": "זוּב", "translit": "zuv", "root": "זהב", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb flow, gush", "gloss": "id.", "definition": "[ זוּב ] verb flow, gush (Late Hebrew id. , Aramaic דּוּב , דִּיב , , all used often in sense 4 below; Arabic (medial ) melt, dissolve, flow ) — only Qal Imperfect יָזוּב Lev 15:25 etc.; Participle זָב Jer 49:9 f. זָבָ֫ה Lev 15:19 etc.; — 1. flow, gush (poetry), of water from the smitten rock Ps 78:20 (|| שָׁטַף ), Ps 105:41 (|| הָלַךְ ), Isa 48:21 (|| נָזַל ). 2. Participle frequently in (אֶרֶץ) זָבַת חָלָב וּדְבַשׁ , always of promised land, Exod 3:8 ; Exod 3:17 ; Exod 13:5 (all J ) Exod 33:3 ; Num 13:27 ; Num 14:8 ; Num 16:13 ; Num 16:14 (all J E ) Deut 6:3 ; Deut 11:9 ; Deut 26:9 ; Deut 26:15 ; Deut 27:3 ; Deut 31:20 ; Josh 5:6 ( D ) Lev 20:24 ( H ) Jer 11:5 ; Jer 32:22 ; Ezek 20:6 ; Ezek 20:15 (in last two insert ארץ ᵐ5 Co ); זָב עִמְקֵךְ Jer 49:4 (fertile valley of Ammon). 3. figurative flow away = pine away (from hunger) Lam 4:9 . 4. flow , of issue from woman (all P ), Lev 15:25 יָזוּב זוֺב דָּמָהּ (see ווֺב ); especially have an issue ( flux, gleet ), of woman Lev 15:25 and Lev 15:19 ( תִּהְיֶה זָבָה ); usually of man, 2Sam 3:29 (|| מְצֹרָע ); elsewhere P , Lev 15:2 זָב מִבִּשָׂרוֺ ; with cognate accusative Lev 15:33 ordinarily Participle זָב one that has an issue Lev 15:4 ; Lev 15:6 ; Lev 15:7 ; Lev 15:8 ; Lev 15:9 ; Lev 15:11 ; Lev 15:12 ; Lev 15:13 ; Lev 15:32 (all P ), Lev 22:4 ( H ; || צָרוּעַ ); also Num 5:2 ( P ; || id. )", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2301')\">BDB2301</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H2100')\">H2100</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2300')\">BDB2300</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2302')\">BDB2302</entry></div><p> [<bdbheb>זוּב</bdbheb>] <b>verb flow, gush</b> (Late Hebrew <highlight>id.</highlight>, Aramaic <bdbarc>דּוּב</bdbarc>, <bdbheb>דִּיב</bdbheb>, <placeholder1430/>, all used often in sense <b>4</b> below; Arab